<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Fab raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Fab raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it upgraded Electronic Fab Technology Corp, which provides electronic manufacturing services, to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- It said company's planned acquisition of Current Electronics, a private firm in the same business, was a positive move.</p>
<p>-- Stephens said the deal was expected to add 80 percent to 100 percent to company's earnings per share in 1997, and raised the estimate to $0.30 per share from $0.15.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 1-1/4 to five.</p>
</text>
